22:15.700 --> 22:17.700
So, I will minimize this window.

22:17.700 --> 22:22.700
And, this is the time plotter for the pressure.

22:22.700 --> 22:31.700
Now, I go to the home.

22:31.700 --> 22:34.700
I start the measuring.

22:34.700 --> 22:40.700
