22:40.700 --> 22:47.700
So, in this case, there is, here, the time changing.

22:47.700 --> 22:50.700
This is the pressure changing.

22:50.700 --> 22:55.700
And, as soon as I stop the measurement, the variable stops.

22:55.700 --> 23:17.700
So, in this case, it's possible to perform analysis on variables using time plotter, using displays, and so on.

23:17.700 --> 23:22.700
Control Desk gives you an interface also with networks.

23:22.700 --> 23:26.700
In this case, there is this panel called bus navigator.

23:26.700 --> 23:35.700
Analyzing the structure of the bus navigator, it's possible to see that, in this case, for example, we have two can.

23:35.700 --> 23:39.700
This is the first controller, and this is the second controller.

23:39.700 --> 23:42.700
So, we have two can.

23:42.700 --> 23:44.700
Of course, we have two controllers.

23:44.700 --> 23:49.700
So, we have two transceivers present on the real Skalexio system.

23:49.700 --> 23:56.700
This is, this gives you information about the real hardware present on the Skalexio.

23:56.700 --> 24:02.700
Adding some boards, it's possible to have numerous time.

24:02.700 --> 24:11.700
Sorry, adding some boards, it's possible also to have multiple cans, multiple links, and so on.

24:11.700 --> 24:18.700
Each board adds some transceivers to have can communications.

24:18.700 --> 24:29.700
In this case, if I expand here the can, I can see all the messages, and if I go here, I can see the signals.

24:29.700 --> 24:32.700
It's possible to have some filters.

24:32.700 --> 24:46.700
In this case, I can add the transmitted and the received messages, only the transmitted messages, and only the received messages.

24:46.700 --> 24:51.700
As you can see, it changes also the shape of this block.

24:51.700 --> 24:57.700
