25:04.700 --> 25:22.700
Now, I will filter for both transmitted and received messages, and I will add, for example, in my layout, the, what is called, generate ticks layout.

25:22.700 --> 25:31.700
So, when I add this, I will add this layout here.

25:31.700 --> 25:37.700
In this layout, I can see that we have some information about the message.

25:37.700 --> 25:41.700
For example, I have information about the ID of the message.

25:41.700 --> 25:51.700
If the message is cyclic enabled, the cycle time that can be changed.

25:51.700 --> 25:55.700
