27:28.700 --> 27:32.700
In this case, in this message, there is only one signal.

27:32.700 --> 27:35.700
This is the signal name.

27:35.700 --> 27:42.700
We can select the source, so if we want the source to be the input, so the model, or a

27:42.700 --> 27:43.700
constant value.

27:43.700 --> 27:48.700
